      "source": "Wikipedia"
    },
    "town": {
      "title": "Manchester",
      "description": "City and metropolitan borough in England",
      "extract": "Manchester is a city and metropolitan borough in North West England, at the centre of the eponymous county of Greater Manchester. It had a population of over 589,000 in 2024. It borders the Cheshire Plain to the south, the Pennines to the north and east, and the city of Salford to the west. The two cities and the surrounding towns form one of the United Kingdom's most populous conurbations, the Greater Manchester Built-up Area, which has a population of 2.87 million.",
      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manchester",
